{"server":"cn","storyId":"act38side_level_act38side_09_beg","groupId":"act38side","stageId":"act38side_09","title":"狼群与群狼","storyCode":"PV-9","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act38side/level_act38side_09_beg.txt","sourceHash":"0baa394e20f72765c1f2e0a6e829e95e13465ca945a4c1ee964270ab3c4da526","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"<i>传说，在大地西边的荒野上游荡着一只神秘的粉色梦魔。</i>\n<i>\\n\\n它以漆黑的焦炭当皮囊，以火烧的云朵为毛发，以扭曲的枯枝作双角。</i>\n<i>\\n\\n路人会被它美好的假面所迷惑，被它甜美的气味熏染得困倦疲乏，不知不觉堕入一重重幻梦中，成为它的养料。</i>\n<i>梦魔诱骗的主要目标是鲁珀小孩，据说在数百年前，它曾在某个夜晚拐走过一座城市里的上万个孩童。</i>\n<i>\\n\\n还好叙拉古人是聪明的，他们想到了办法对抗这位可怕的粉色梦魔——</i>\n<i>\\n\\n梦魔天生怕狼。所以，只需要在遇见它的时候朝它大喊三声“狼来了！”，梦魔就会消失得无影无踪。</i>"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我实在是听不下去了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_i10_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"别激动，多利。这个乐手也没胡说，在叙拉古的传说里，羊确实就是这么个形象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你要实在气不过，就从羊花车蹦到他头上踩几脚，反正今天晚上发生什么都没人会觉得稀奇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我只是曾经喜欢被那些狼追着跑，在叙拉古的那阵子，和他们捉迷藏算是我为数不多的乐趣......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"结果叙拉古人却以为我“害怕”那些狼？真是人言可畏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这个成语可不是这么用的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你在说风凉话吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"大帝，你在叙拉古人的认知里是什么样的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"大嘴巴，告诉他黑袍歌唱家的伟大事迹！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃......从前有个家族领袖非常讨厌音乐，他禁止了音乐在他的城市出现，直到许多年后一位黑袍企鹅歌手到来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"歌手在广场上自顾自唱歌，市民们对音乐没有概念，他们只觉得吵闹，所以想要把歌手抓起来交给家族领袖处罚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可歌手非常灵活，再精壮的小伙子也抓不住他......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"歌声不停，越来越多的人加入抓捕的队伍，渐渐，歌手与市民的搏斗变成了一场所有人都卷入其中的舞蹈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"歌手就这么唱了三天三夜，直到怒不可遏的家族领袖亲自来抓他。可家族领袖一出门就被狂欢的人潮淹没，再也没有人见过他——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"为什么听起来像是聪明又正义的大英雄，可大帝明明不如我有智慧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这不是智慧，是态度。是潘格温伯爵对音乐的态度，自由与抗争！多利，我送你的签名专辑你是不是都没有听？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，别挡住后面人的路。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_i10_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乐手","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（兴奋地吹奏）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杂耍艺人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（兴奋地表演火舞）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乐手","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（更卖力地吹奏）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杂耍艺人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（不服输地炫技）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_i10_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路人A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"阿基莱，我的阿基莱呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路人B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唉，女士，您才发现自己和陌生人并肩走了半个小时吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路人A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊，我认得你的声音，你是之前特尔尼城的那个法官！对不起，是莱卡家族的人逼迫我做伪证——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路人B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（敲了敲面具）那都是过去的事了。女士，您违反了狂欢节的规则。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路人B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"看看身边，大家都戴上了面具，今夜，无所谓身份、贫富、种族，忘却过往的仇恨......请我喝杯啤酒吧，为新沃尔西尼举杯！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_i10_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"人群从三位兽主的身边经过，多利的分身往来穿梭，所有人都看得见它们，但无人大惊小怪。\n身处狂欢的洪流之中，没有一朵浪花称得上异样。\n十多辆巨型花车前后相连，狼、羊、企鹅、猫、狗......传说中散落大地各处的野兽们齐聚在同一个城市，引领着人群向前。\n传统戏剧表演和即兴演出挤满了街道，乐手与杂耍艺人像是比赛般炫技，食品车车主不得不一次次提高音量来兜售啤酒、披萨和冰淇淋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这里比喷薄的火山还要热闹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"总比之前的狂欢节要好，连肥仔都不喜欢那样的派对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我不会把所有混黑帮的戴着面具杀来杀去搞得整个城市都血淋淋的行为称为“派对”，别侮辱这个词。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"一棵树上结不出两种果子，叙拉古人和那些狼真的太像了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"几千上万年前，我们嫌那些只知道厮杀的狼太蠢，每次开派对都不带他们，结果他们自己鼓捣出了所谓的狼主游戏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不过好在叙拉古人总算有了点长进，知道生活中有比杀人和抢地盘更值得庆祝的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"至于那群一根筋的狼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"肥仔，我们感受到的“不对劲”，他们肯定也感受到了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有些事还是得找他们商量，谁让我们是“同胞”呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我已经见过他们里面没那么蠢的了，但在那无聊的游戏结束前，他们是听不进去任何话的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"按炎国话说，暂时先“入乡随俗”吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"别辜负派对！叙拉古人最好安排了些更有趣的节目！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_vipward"},{"type":"narration","text":"<p=2>1100年11月9日    9:25 P.M.</>\n风吹在了德米特里的脸上。\n他记得自己昨天离开时病房的窗户紧闭着，拉维妮娅也叮嘱过护士，深秋时节要注意室内的温度——他抬眼看去，病床上已经空了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好久不见，德米特。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"私人医生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，莱昂图索先生，这个人非要闯进来。市政厅和法院的电话都暂时打不通，我联系不上拉维妮娅法官......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_npc_1541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系，你先去忙吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你什么时候醒的？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"炫目的灯光搅动夜空，也把房间点亮，隔着窗户都能隐隐听到人潮那喧天的动静。莱昂图索就站在窗边，看着狂欢中的城市。\n他已经换下了病服，完全看不出是个不久前还在昏迷的病人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_npc_1541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"几个小时前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_npc_1541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"德米特，想不到我们久别重逢，地点从餐厅变成了病房。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还记得自己昏迷之前的行程，挺好。看来车祸没有真的伤到你的脑子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_npc_1541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_npc_1541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"才刚醒，就把自己收拾得这么利落，别告诉我你打算赶去狂欢节的现场。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"护士想必说过，此时此刻你更应该躺回去休息......你里面的绷带都还没拆吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_npc_1541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"头有一点晕，刚刚吃了药，还好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_npc_1541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今夜，数十万民众都将走上街头，共享狂欢，庆祝新沃尔西尼建成一周年。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_npc_1541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"按照原本的计划，巡游的队伍将从拓展地块开始，经过九个地块的二十三条街道，沿途解锁各种庆典活动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_npc_1541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最终，他们会在午夜时分到达城市的地标——法院广场，而我会在那里发表演说，和所有人共同迎接新一天的到来——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"市政厅会安排其他活动来填补这个空白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你大可以等到状态更好的时候，再宣布正式就任市长。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_npc_1541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"德米特，你是这么想的吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"莱昂图索转过了身。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_i18"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"直到现在，拉维妮娅都没有向民众通知演说已经取消，我不觉得她是忙忘了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这几天发生的事情我已经知道了个大概。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"港口区的车祸，紧接着是新沃尔西尼港失火......如果市长缺席今晚原定的活动，民众们会作何想？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果狂欢节平安无事，我的缺席只不过会损害一些我个人的信用，那自然是没什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但如果此刻窗外绚烂的灯光下，真的藏了一些东西，我需要在现场。就这么简单。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好了，德米特，我们没能完成的聚餐就改日吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就今天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"狂欢节已经开始，整个城市都在忙碌，医生刚刚不是说了，市政厅和法院的电话都打不通。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"此时此刻，他们很难临时为你抽调人手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我带了一些人，我们可以护送你去现场。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......你没有选择，莱昂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"既然这几天的变故你已有认知，那么我和萨卢佐的事情你多少也知道了一些，但你刚刚并没有提及。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我有些话必须跟你说，今天正好是个机会。"},{"type":"narration","text":"莱昂图索注视着自己的故友。\n他不是没有听出德米特里话里的威胁，短暂的沉默后，他向着对方伸出手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那就辛苦你了，德米特。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"像以前一样。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wilderness_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"外婆，你还好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外婆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的孩子，你迷路了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"红在找最后的真狼，已经浪费了很多时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外婆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别着急，孩子，这不怪你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外婆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真狼的皮毛上总会有气味，外婆教过你分辨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外婆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但最后的真狼恰好是一个擅长编织皮毛，从而将自己的气味完美隐藏起来的家伙，他是一个......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_g4_newvolsiniialley_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"......裁缝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"外婆仍在指引红。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"红很快就会找到真狼，外婆等红。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"......德蒙塔诺。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_g2_newvolsiniistreet_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"该死，*乌萨斯粗口*！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡车司机","speakerId":"avg_npc_1550_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎、怎么了，柳德米拉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......红色的连帽衫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡车司机","speakerId":"avg_npc_1550_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又是那个家伙？哪儿呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"前面的巷子，就在刚刚，我不会看错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡车司机","speakerId":"avg_npc_1550_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我俩下车换个轮胎，这么短的工夫，怎么偏偏又让你看见了那个家伙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡车司机","speakerId":"avg_npc_1550_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要去追吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上车吧，伊雷妮还在等我们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上一次为了追她，我将索默尔留在车祸现场，之后发生了这么多荒唐的事情......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说起来也真可笑，我一次次遇见那个家伙，倒霉的事情也一件接着一件，像是一个没法打破的魔咒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们今天要对付的，是一群残忍的狼，我见识过他们的手段。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以这一次，我必须要留在你们身边。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡车司机","speakerId":"avg_npc_1550_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，别在意，柳德米拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡车司机","speakerId":"avg_npc_1550_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那家伙在你复仇的时候戏弄你，还杀了你的老师，要是我，肯定会比你更控制不住自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡车司机","speakerId":"avg_npc_1550_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样吧，等今天晚上这些烂糟糟的事情都结束，大家伙陪你去找她，狠狠地痛扁她一顿，再把她倒挂在车后面吃灰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡车司机","speakerId":"avg_npc_1550_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有我们在，以后没人敢欺负我们的倒霉蛋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵。别贫了，走吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g11_mansionhall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我来了......啧，这地方可真难找。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"老板，咱们的人都已经就位了。不过这么关键的时候，你不去现场盯着吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"过来看。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"法院广场？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我过来时东拐西拐，以为快走到另一个城区了。结果这栋房子离法院广场这么近？我甚至看得到法院窗户上的招贴画......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"足够隐蔽，但广场及周围干道发生了什么都一目了然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尘埃落定之前，我会待在这里，实时发布命令。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"仓促之间，你是怎么找到这种地方并买下来的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它一直在我的名下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我来到新沃尔西尼后不久就买下了这里，偶尔会过来坐坐，给自己休个假。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......看着法院和市政厅大楼休假？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......老家主安顿得怎么样了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心。宅邸里留了人，我也准备了足够多的威士忌和雪茄，还有典藏版的唱片，老家主今夜都不需要离开他的房间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"港口？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"甘比诺已经搞定了。今天晚上，只有我们的陆行舰能够锁定并靠近这座移动城市......算算时间，也应该差不多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可调用的载具都已经到达新沃尔西尼港附近，一旦陆行舰完成接驳，我们会马上把船上的“货”卸下来，送到每一位成员手里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下来，就看我们这边了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"游行的队伍到哪儿了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"新艺术区，那边全是剧场和娱乐设施，沿街安排了非常多的演出，还有花车与游客互动的活动，热闹非凡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有一个多小时的时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"附近的成员虽然数量不多，但都是家族的精锐，此前运进城的武器也已经给他们装备上了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"此时新沃尔西尼大半警力都在沿途维持秩序，广场的安保力量相对薄弱，趁着这个空档，尽快控制法院和其他行政大楼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样一来，港口和法院便都落入了我们手中，加上陆行舰的补给，威尼斯家族便能在实际上控制整个新沃尔西尼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"彻夜狂欢的几十万新沃尔西尼人，都该清醒了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我突然想到一件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"按照市政厅的安排，巡游队伍抵达广场时，将看到莱昂图索发表就职演说，新秩序啊叙拉古的未来啊什么的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然到时候迎接他们的是全副武装的威尼斯家族，老板，你是不是也应该说些什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没那个必要，卡彭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"此时此刻，你应该在意的是，当了那么久的载具公司职员，拿起武器时手会不会生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡彭，我了解过你们的历史。叙拉古历史上的第一场城邦战争便是由西西里人所发起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们在城市里横行，将武器对准每一个出声反抗的人，用镰刀收割战败者的尾巴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"某种意义上，那才是叙拉古的第一场“狂欢节”，尽管后来才有这个贴切的名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"证明给我看，西西里人，证明是你们开启了叙拉古的历史。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，这种动员你应该对着甘比诺做，只有那家伙还会把“西西里人”这种词挂在嘴边。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"龙门、沃尔西尼、新沃尔西尼......这几年我们已经辗转了足够多的地方。西西里夫人抛弃家族后，如今的西西里人连立足都困难。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也正因如此，我永远不会忘记怎么扣动扳机。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，动手吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_g6_courtsquare_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“狂欢节路人A”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1557_1","isRemote":false,"text":"狂欢节快乐，警察先生，拿着这个气球！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警察","speakerId":"avg_npc_1553_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢......欸，你们等等！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警察","speakerId":"avg_npc_1553_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巡游的队伍这么快就到了吗？我怎么没有收到前面几个路口的通知？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警察","speakerId":"avg_npc_1553_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咕——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警察","speakerId":"avg_npc_1553_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳，你们是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“狂欢节路人B”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1556_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，这个反应能力，比我想象的还差。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“狂欢节路人A”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1557_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那不然呢，你以为还在帮着市长大人拍宣传片呢，警察三两下就把咱们全制服？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“狂欢节路人A”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1557_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们满打满算也就上岗了一年吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“狂欢节路人A”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1557_1","isRemote":false,"text":"新沃尔西尼不存在家族，他们平日里也就查查交通事故，你还指望他们有刀口舔血的觉悟和本事？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“狂欢节路人C”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"广场左边的守卫已经清理干净。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“狂欢节路人D”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"右边的也是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“狂欢节路人E”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"法院和行政大楼之间的两条路也搞定了，没留活口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“狂欢节路人F”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有几个文员出来送材料，在门口被我逮住了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“狂欢节路人F”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"该死，其中有一个挣脱逃回法院了——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别抱怨了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"时间差不多了，动手！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_g14_governmentoffice_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"几点了，德克萨斯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"十一点。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"给，你要的威士忌，加了点冰块。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这路线图你都翻来覆去看了好几遍了，休息一下吧，拉维妮娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"广场周围的闲杂人等都已经清空，新艺术区到这里的道路管制也已经完成，接下来只需要等待游行的队伍经过。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你考虑得怎么样了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果站上花车发表午夜演说的，是“最后的德克萨斯”，而非原定的代理市长，你不怕引起不必要的恐慌吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这倒是不用担心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今夜的每一辆花车都是传说中或残忍或神秘的野兽，戴上面具扮演狼群的市民也多的是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但无论是怎样的兽，怎样的人，今夜都将在新沃尔西尼相携而行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"由“最后的德克萨斯”向全城民众发表一些美好的展望，恰恰是符合狂欢节的主题的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"更何况，我确实想不到还有什么重量级嘉宾能顶替莱昂图索。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我再看看你写的发言稿吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，德克萨斯，我必须为所有的变数做好准备。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从卡车营地回来后，你一直有些心神不宁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尽管我已经在最短时间内采取了行动，但隐患并没有被彻底排除。今天晚上——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐慌的文员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1562_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳——拉维妮娅法官，不、不好了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你身上的血......怎么回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐慌的文员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1562_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一大群人突然出现在广场，他们制服了戒严的警察......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谁的人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐慌的文员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1562_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都穿着礼服，戴着狂欢节的面具......认不出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐慌的文员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1562_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但看他们的架势，好像是打算冲进法院！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你赶紧去处理一下伤口，我出去看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐慌的文员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1562_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行，拉维妮娅法官，现在广场的各个方向都是他们的人！您这个时候出去——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果真是这样，躲在这里又有什么用呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐慌的文员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1562_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我陪着你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你还是待在这里吧，拉维妮娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"外面的事情交给我来处理。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊雷妮？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"外面都是家族的人，他们的目标是这栋大楼，还有作为大法官的你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉维妮娅，我是来保护你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"保护我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要怎么——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"拉维妮娅扑向了窗边。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_g6_courtsquare_n"},{"type":"narration","text":"黑暗中蛰伏已久的兽群终于开始了狩猎。\n一群群身穿华服、头戴面具的人从附近的巷子里钻出，向着法院逼近，他们井然有序，很快越过了警戒线。\n可他们没能继续前进。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一辆卡车突然出现在视野里，急刹，横停，拦在了他们的必经之路上。被卡车撞翻的路障在空中翻飞，落地时发出钝响。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"紧接着，第二辆、第三辆......一辆又一辆卡车冲进了广场，从各个方向将冲锋的人群隔绝在了法院之外。\n它们突然出现，表现出惊人的默契，彼此之间首尾相连，像是截住了潮水的堤坝。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_g14_governmentoffice_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请放心，那群人暂时没法靠近法院。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我总觉得在哪里见过这个场景......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这位小姐，或许您看过市政厅为莱昂图索先生拍摄的那部就职宣传片。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"暴动的家族开来卡车，将法院团团围住，在城市里创造了一个警察触碰不到的真空地带，方便他们倾泻暴力......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要不是在剧组里帮过忙，我一时间还想不到用这个法子来对付他们。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"伊雷妮关上了窗户。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，拉维妮娅，时间并不多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们还有不少问题需要解决。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_144_red","aliases":["红"]}]}
